{"about_the_game":"Wandering Meatbags is a zombie FPS shooter. <br />\r\nZombies are rushing at you in a big city, you have to walk around to find loot boxes, keep the best weapons and watch your ammo. <br />\r\nIf you're lucky, you'll get a rifle, a shotgun or even a revolver, but if you don't, you'll have to deal with them with an axe or a knife.<br />\r\nAnd don't underestimate the little flare gun, it's pretty... explosive !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will find walking zombies and running zombies that are dismemberable.<br />\r\nEvery 5 waves you will have a deposit of breakable crates around the city, which includes weapons, ammo and health.<br />\r\nYou need to find them before more zombies come running at you and before you run out of ammo.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1812260?t=1764706752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764706752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764706752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764706752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and dismemberment."},"detailed_description":"Wandering Meatbags is a zombie FPS shooter. <br />\r\nZombies are rushing at you in a big city, you have to walk around to find loot boxes, keep the best weapons and watch your ammo. <br />\r\nIf you're lucky, you'll get a rifle, a shotgun or even a revolver, but if you don't, you'll have to deal with them with an axe or a knife.<br />\r\nAnd don't underestimate the little flare gun, it's pretty... explosive !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will find walking zombies and running zombies that are dismemberable.<br />\r\nEvery 5 waves you will have a deposit of breakable crates ar